SOPHIE (soejrd/digisophie, MIT): its render lighter, the same output bit for bit; digitakt.c builds with
any m68k GCC. Applied by tools/dev.sh to the copy it builds (until upstream has it).
Made against soejrd/digisophie fee5f51; tests/sophie_fast.py checks it.

